  "text_md": "## GREATER GOOD INTERNSHIP FUND-APPLICATION FORM\n\nThis form must be e-mailed with all other required documents to Megan Boris **(mtboris@iu.edu) no later than 5pm** **on Friday, April 20th, 2018.** Put GREATER GOOD INTERNSHIP FUND in the subject line. Applications with incomplete information or missing documents will not be considered.\n\n# Contact Information\n\nName Local Address City State Zip Phone () E-mail Student ID (10-digit) #\n\n# Academic Standing\n\nClass Degree Major(s) Minor(s) # of Credits Completed Graduation Date (Mo/Yr)\n\n# Reference\n\nList the name, telephone number and e-mail for the faculty member who will be writing a letter of reference for you: Name Phone () E-mail\n\n# Internship Details\n\nOrganization Internship Start date End date Location Supervisor Name Phone () E-mail I confirm that information on this form is correct and accurate. S**IGNATURE DATE** SPEA Career Development Office 812-855-9639 speacare@indiana.edu 1315 E. 10thSt. Bloomington, IN 47405 Room 200\n",
